+// like any other and the properties fail on them, naming the shape in the failure
+// (hegel/known.mjs); each bug also has a property over its shape alone (the section before the
+// pins) and a pin. HEGEL_NO_KNOWN=1 asks for a run that looks past the known bugs: the generators
